{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/1692","id":5254056467,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQ8oa8s8AAAABOSqKEw","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1692","diff_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1692.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/pull/1692.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/issues/1692","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/1692/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/1692/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/issues/1692/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/statuses/6fce88bdc343d55093d762daecc6557f1a7d5401","number":1692,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[I17:E02] Fields Behavior Candidates and Before-use Cycle Checks","user":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Overview\n\nThe shared skill checker reports execution under a declared Fields section, lists fields whose prose derives behavior as non-failing review candidates, and reports cycles in the explicit before-use requirement graph with a closed witness. The installed Work Planner model selects the Fields checks through its `contracts` declaration; its rules name the kinds that decide Callable Transformations, Boundary Review and Before-use Ordering.\n\n## Changes\n\n### Checker\n\n- **Fields execution.**\n  `executable step in Fields`: a numbered step, a numbered heading, or Apply/Follow/Run on an operation or command link inside the declared contract section. A definition link to an operation and specimen text are not execution; invocations there keep their existing kinds.\n- **Fields behavior candidates.**\n  `Fields behavior candidate`: a field whose prose has an actor or an instruction perform a behavior across two kinds (acquire, write, route, transition). Each candidate names its heading line, the line and kinds of each clause and its file's operations as possible owner. Tables, fences, invocations and code spans are not read. A candidate prints and fails nothing; semantic review decides it.\n- **Before-use cycles.**\n  `before-use cycle`: the graph of explicit requirements (`Read ... first.`/`Read ... before ...` sentences, Prerequisites links, declared cross-file preamble links), where a whole-file read takes all of a file's requirements and a heading read its section's and the file introduction's. One closed witness per strongly connected set names each node and the line of the requirement leaving it. Ordinary links, field references and execution calls impose no order.\n\n### Tests\n\n- **test_check_skill_files.**\n  FieldsBoundary, BeforeUseOrdering and InstalledWorkPlannerModel, with the pinned 756aaf9 Prerequisites inventory as a fixture.\n\n### Rules\n\n- **work-planner/rules.json.**\n  Callable Transformations names `executable step in Fields`, Boundary Review `Fields behavior candidate`, Before-use Ordering `before-use cycle`, each beside review.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n| Test | Description | Coverage | Pass |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| T1 | Pinned Status Changes, a paraphrase, another subject's derivation and two W02 mixed fields are candidates with located evidence; enum, type, conditional-invariant, result-shape, retained-value, table and specimen controls are not; Fields execution reported at its lines | AC9 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/87e80b73f735de102a5775f8d9d8f619125eb05e/artifacts/planning/2026-11-11-1615-i17-e02-w37-detect-fields-behavior-and/validation.md#observing-tests) |\n| T2 | Calibration over the 518 W02 ledger fields: no shape or invariant field is a candidate; installed tree reports none | AC9 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/87e80b73f735de102a5775f8d9d8f619125eb05e/artifacts/planning/2026-11-11-1615-i17-e02-w37-detect-fields-behavior-and/validation.md#calibration) |\n| T3 | Installed Work Planner graph is the 38 audited requirements, acyclic, with every entry reaching rules and conventions | AC11 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/87e80b73f735de102a5775f8d9d8f619125eb05e/artifacts/planning/2026-11-11-1615-i17-e02-w37-detect-fields-behavior-and/validation.md#observing-tests) |\n| T4 | Self, multi-document, cross-file section, preamble and the measured 13-artifact cycles reported with closed witnesses; diamond, conditional, bounded-read, field-reference, retry and specimen controls report none | AC13 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/87e80b73f735de102a5775f8d9d8f619125eb05e/artifacts/planning/2026-11-11-1615-i17-e02-w37-detect-fields-behavior-and/validation.md#observing-tests) |\n| T5 | The new classes fail at the base checker, apart from two controls | AC9, AC11, AC13 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/87e80b73f735de102a5775f8d9d8f619125eb05e/artifacts/planning/2026-11-11-1615-i17-e02-w37-detect-fields-behavior-and/validation.md#base-control) |\n| T6 | Full planner and shared suites, skill checker and whitespace | AC9, AC11, AC13 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/87e80b73f735de102a5775f8d9d8f619125eb05e/artifacts/planning/2026-11-11-1615-i17-e02-w37-detect-fields-behavior-and/validation.md#full-checks) |\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [Work item](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/87e80b73f735de102a5775f8d9d8f619125eb05e/artifacts/planning/2026-11-11-1615-i17-e02-w37-detect-fields-behavior-and/w37.md) — declared components and observing validation.\n- **R2.** [Validation](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/87e80b73f735de102a5775f8d9d8f619125eb05e/artifacts/planning/2026-11-11-1615-i17-e02-w37-detect-fields-behavior-and/validation.md) — diagnostics, observing tests, base control, calibration and logs.\n- **R3.** [Epic #1615](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/issues/1615) — AC9, AC11, AC13.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","labels":[{"id":12663716298,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQ8oa8s8AAAAC8tD5yg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/workflow-server/labels/bot:ai-assisted","name":"bot:ai-assisted","description":null,"color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-11T04:55:22Z","updated_at":"2026-11-11T04:55:46Z","closed_at":"2026-11-11T04:55:46Z","merged_at":"2026-11-11T04:55:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"96241be5ba2c98e009cdfc4d1983d2e53393ea6d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"m2ux:i17/e02/w37-detect-fields-behavior-and","ref":"i17/e02/w37-detect-fields-behavior-and","repo":{"id":1137318642,"node_id":"R_kgDOQ8oa8g","name":"workflow-server","full_name":"m2ux/workflow-server","owner":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/foll